<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - NationsBank raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - NationsBank raised.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Raymond James said it upgraded NationsBank Corp to buy from accumulate.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- On Monday, NationsBank posted second quarter earnings of $1.02 per diluted share compared with $0.99 per diluted share last year.</p>
<p>-- NationsBank lost 5/16 to 67.</p>
</text>
